Hello,

Someone, hopefully you, asked to join the <%= @product.name %> waitlist with this address. To confirm your place, open this link:

<%= @confirm_url %>

The link works for <%= Rails.configuration.x.confirmation_validity.in_days.to_i %> days. If you don't confirm, your address is deleted after that and you won't hear from us again.

If this wasn't you, ignore this email.
<% if @product.places_per_referral.positive? %>
Once you've confirmed, share your own link. For everyone who joins through it and confirms their email, you move up <%= @product.places_per_referral %> places:
<%= @referral_url %>
<% end %>
You can leave the list and delete your details at any time:
<%= @leave_url %>

<%= @product.name %>, <%= @product.site_url %>
Privacy: <%= @product.privacy_url %>
